WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.760
Hey, I'm back to my real-world self.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.740
Where is this place?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.410
I know! They sell hamburgers here!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.580
Hm?

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.580
Prism Stone?

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.580
What's going on?

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.380
Wait, what? I don't get it.

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.860
Why can we see Prism Stone from here?

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.640
The answer should go without saying.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.250
It means we're outside PriPara right now.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.410
So that's why our Coords disappeared?

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:16.140
That would be it.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.490
What?

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:18.810
Pushu...

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:19.700
Sophie-san!
Sophie!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:24.300
But it's closed! And I really want to eat a hamburger!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.780
It's a revelation that you yearn for more than meat buns.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:27.570
Here you go.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.540
Thankies!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.170
That reminds me: in the Summer Grand Prix...

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.480
What was Andou-san doing there...?

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.930
Phantom Thief Genius! There's no use hiding-Da Vinci!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.260
I'll arrest you through and th-Ruvens, just watch me-chelangelo-Da Vinci!

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.480
There's nothing here.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:48.040
Devi? So he was aware we had invaded his sanctuary.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:48.730
Hey...

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.250
That's the principal's hair.

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.560
Yes, it is.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.660
Hey, we're in there too!

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.900
Hi there!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.690
So who's recording us, then?

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.820
A purple butterfly...

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.660
It was a spy camera?

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:07.250
That granted him twenty-four hour surveillance of PriPara.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:12.580
Yes, and he invaded the system and PriPara itself using this computer.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.330
That emblem...

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.930
It's Hibiki-san's.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.130
What?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.420
The evidence has been gathered.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.450
The Phantom Genius is Shikyouin Hibiki!

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.020
The deputy principal?

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.460
That Shikyouin?

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.980
Yeah, I can see that.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.850
How shock-limt!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.860
One good Turner deserves another!
Shikyouin Hibiki must be arrested-Da Vinci!

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:36.850
So it's true...

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.010
Fuwari-chan!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.760
What's that?

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.730
You've discovered the thief's identity?

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:44.530
Lala and the others just contacted us-kuma!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.330
They said it's Shikyouin Hibiki!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.780
What?

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.960
You mean the movie star famous outside PriPara?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.170
He's also the acting deputy principal at Paprika Academy!

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.060
How many more minutes until we reach PriPara?

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.690
Fifteen minutes if we hurry.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.500
Eleven if we really hurry!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.180
Please really hurry!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.040
Roger!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:06.530
We need to get there quickly...

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:07.580
If we hurry...

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.970
What is his goal, anyway?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.820
This is turning into something bad-kuma.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:18.060
If he comes back, we're gonna catch him-panda!

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:18.800
Pan!

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.170
How are things over there-usa?

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.360
We're all ready to ambush him-Da Vinci!

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:27.660
He's bound to come this way if we just wait for him.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.410
C'mon, PriPara Police!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:30.120
Capisce!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.850
Yep!

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:35.040
I can't believe the phantom thief would turn out to be Hibiki-san...

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.100
I feel I know less anything about him than ever.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:50.240
There he is!

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.640
He's coming this way!

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.970
Um... what was it...

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:58.000
"The star of justice shines in my heart!"

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.370
He's going past.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:21.940
What?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.880
Why's he going into Prism Stone?

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:28.780
I don't understand!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.740
How shock-limt Egon Schiele!

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.120
Come on, after him!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.220
It won't open!

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.330
Where's the exit?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.260
Over here?

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.360
It's locked from the outside!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:40.600
Hey...

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:41.050
Isn't that...

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:42.140
Shikyouin Hibiki-sama?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.660
Why's he in PriPara?

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.090
Welcome to PriPara!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.010
Is this your first visit to PriPara?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:48.890
I suppose so.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.050
He's a man, right?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.660
I'll take your ticket, please.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:52.770
Certainly.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:53.960
There we go.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:58.480
I'll now determine your brand with the Fashion Scope.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.420
Be my guest.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.210
The brand suited to you...

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.480
Is... say, this is...

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:09.020
The as-yet unworn brand...

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:12.340
For those celebrities among all celebrities,

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.060
said to befit only a true star...

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.940
Brilliant Prince!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.890
I can't believe it!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.260
And now your registration is complete.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:23.410
Thank you.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:26.280
May we meet at the dawn of the PriPara revolution.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.280
A toast to your good fortune.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.580
The Brilliant Prince Cyalume Coord.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:41.130
The long velour coat expresses true luxury!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:45.120
And the shining crown accessory embodies a heroic prince!

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:46.940
Isn't that...

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:47.860
It couldn't be...

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.970
Hibiki-sama?

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.610
A news bulletin.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:55.860
A bearer of the legendary Celeb brand has appeared in PriPara at last.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.600
That brand: Brilliant Prince!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.690
The bearer: Hibiki-san!

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.770
He looks a fine man-nekon.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.420
Shikyouin Hibiki is in PriPara?

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.120
A man in PriPara-panda!

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.860
Shikyouin's in PriPara-kuma!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:10.930
We're well awar-uvens!

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.950
Arrest him!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.410
Here.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:15.870
Here.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.010
Are boys allowed in now?

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.540
That must be it!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.100
Hibiki-sama!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.000
Go!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.090
I'd like to enter, please.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.930
Your manager?

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.090
No manager necessary.

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:36.820
How novel!

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.440
Okay, just a moment.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:48.940
He's managed to enter PriPara; the system's protocols must have been overwritten.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.780
Did he use Hologrammation?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.910
Or did the stars simply align?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.580
Have a good show.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.840
Well, then – I'll see you at the performance.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.370
Okay!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.260
Hibiki-sama!

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.360
I'm so glad boys are allowed in now!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.290
This excitement is unbelievable.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.590
Keep going-Da Vinci!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.010
Hibiki-sama!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.580
Prince-sama!

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.690
When the wings which soar in the sky are spread...

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.700
A sole lilium casa blanca shall bloom in the darkness!

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.380
My name... is Phantom Thief Genius!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.020
But why?

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:34.940
Where's Hibiki-sama?

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:35.540
No way!

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.450
Why's he in his Phantom Thief outfit?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:41.060
I've appeared to reveal my true form.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.750
Shikyouin Hibiki – pleased to meet you.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.020
There he is! Hibiki-sama!

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:48.680
So...

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:49.840
Huh?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.090
Which means...

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:52.960
Indeed.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.550
For my noble aim, I have played the role of this phantom thief.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.400
What?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.260
He's spilling it!

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.760
Quickly! We have to take him to the PriPara HQ for judgement!

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.640
Arrest him-panda!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.200
What?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.280
The phantom thief was Shikyouin Hibiki?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.170
Come off it, now!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.530
You're too much, Prince-sama!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.530
Show us that historic boy's performance!

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.970
Oh, and I should add....

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:16.900
I'm a girl.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:18.200
What?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:18.920
What was that?

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.480
Surely not...

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.040
Should I repeat myself?

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.760
I'm a girl.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.160
My birth certificate.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:40.470
Wha-at?

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.770
Mister magician?

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.650
A... girl...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.570
My whole worldview is destroyed-glo!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.260
Fuwari! Fuwari! Are you okay-tori?

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.110
We have to get to a hospital!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.880
Let's Gauguin! We have to Picasso up out feet and catch this Tarou Oka-most heinous criminal!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.650
I can't.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:00.380
What?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:03.250
I was born to protect idols.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.850
If Hibiki-san is a woman,

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:08.520
she hasn't stolen in, but entered as a legitimate idol.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.380
What?

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:10.600
Hmph.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:12.780
Well, then.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.920
Listen well now to the message of she, who stands at last...

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.760
upon the stage of her beloved PriPara.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.600
Hibiki-sama!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.010
Show us what you've got!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.360
Making Drama, switch on!

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.090
Onward!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.600
I will uphold it!

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.880
Sapphire revolution!

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.140
Pristine rhapsody!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.140
The wheels of revolution will not turn without sacrifice!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.160
Airy Change!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.510
Gold Airy!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.280
She's produced an Airy Change outside the Dream Theatre?

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.280
Hibiki-sama!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:05.690
She's amazing!

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:07.880
Prince-sama!

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:11.810
How did she pull off her Celeb Gold Airy like that?

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.020
She simply seized the hearts and minds of the audience.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:16.900
Incredible.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.450
It was really amazing.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.120
An overwhelming performance.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.020
Amazing...

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.650
That was incredible!

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.840
Wonderful!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:43.480
I can't believe we heard such an amazing star sing!

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:48.540
Everyone loved your song so much. They're still standing.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.800
Hearing it from you, Princess Falulu, is the greatest honour.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.260
You're the magician I met back then, aren't you?

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:55.820
I am.

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.440
Because you wished upon a star.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.880
Yes, I'm really glad I met you again.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.010
But...

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.280
Do you dislike my true face?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.490
No, it's wonderful.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.530
But...

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.800
Hey, why can't we get in-kuma?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.020
You're the one who called us here-pri!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.860
And even if you hadn't, we've got a bone to pick with you!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.100
Lautr-et us in!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.140
Let's Gauguin!

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.050
Maho-chan, are you okay?

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.050
"Maho-chan"?

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.700
I'll call you that from now on!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.330
You're not barred from entering.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.450
Your entrance is this way

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.720
Please enter through here.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.690
Ponkan's gonna be firs-Titian!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.530
A black Meganee-kuma?

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.490
I've never seen one before-usa.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:35.660
What's going on-pri?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.180
You don't think-nekon...

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.190
Sentence Ender Room

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:42.820
Hey! What's big idea-pri?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:48.330
This room has been prepared separately
due to Hibiki-san's weakness against sentence enders.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.020
What's that? It's easel to get in on sentence enders!

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:53.710
Just rememb-randt: you can do anything you set your mind to!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:54.410
Pri!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.300
Mirei!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:58.690
Let me out-pri! I'm ap-pri-ealing you here! Pri has a pri-oud and illustrious pedi-pri, you know...

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.080
Why have you done this?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.220
Let them out!

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:03.880
If it did, this exchange would be a futile prospect.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:04.840
Exchange?

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.510
Hey, my Dream Tickets!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.250
Falulu, why are you here?

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.940
Hibiki's a bad person, you know!

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.040
That's not true, Lala.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:16.700
Huh?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:19.060
I'm going to join Maho-chan's team.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:19.820
Huh?

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:20.850
I thought so...

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.730
"Maho-chan"...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.570
C'mon, Maho-chan, gimme my Dream Tickets back.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.800
So you manipulated the system after all.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.180
I suppose I did.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.240
But only to a minor degree.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.020
I want to discuss this calmly.

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:40.290
Why did you steal our Dream Tickets?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.590
I want to compete with you in the Winter Dream Idol Grand Prix...

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.290
with these Dream Tickets on the line.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.130
What?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.900
I guarantee, more than anyone else here,

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.590
I love PriPara.

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.980
There's no way that's true! I really, <i>really</i> love PriPara!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.890
You said it, Lala-pri!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:06.960
Yep!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:07.200
That's right!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.270
PriPara and Aroma are really important to me!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.050
Don't underestimate us!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.610
Then I want to prove just whose love is greater.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:18.730
Were I to say that alone,
who would have reason to compete?

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.580
That's why I took your Dream Tickets.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.820
When you were being all thief-y...

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:26.620
"These Dream Tickets do not befit you."

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.800
You totally said that!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.060
Of course, that is true as well.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:35.010
Compared to my love, yours is simply vacuous.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.260
What does vacuous mean?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.310
It means an empty expression, with no depth or pri-fundity!

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:43.580
We've got to the point in a somewhat roundabout fashion,

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:47.180
but let us do battle – me with a genius team befitting my own ideals,

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:51.740
and you in a team formed according to <i>your</i> ideals.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.910
Surely the stronger love will win through.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.810
'Scuse me for a moment here,
but aren't you a high schooler?

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:02.870
Don't you feel a little embarrassed,
challenging us middle schoolers and primary schoolers?

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.830
Should I hold back, then?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:10.320
If I win, I will reform PriPara.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.000
What?

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.180
The Saints...

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.500
It's the Saints...

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:21.940
Our erstwhile Divine Idols.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.580
Their era was unsurpassed.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:29.230
Only those whose greatness was
acknowledged by all stood upon the stage.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:34.650
And yet in the current PriPara,
there exists not a single Divine Idol.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.510
It's an assembly of rank amateurs, after all.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.340
I want to restore PriPara to its golden age.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.560
Pri-pri-pri!

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.540
So what if we're amateurs?

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.210
We're all friends! We're all idols!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.540
That's what's so great about PriPara!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.000
We all do our best to rank up!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.840
That's what makes PriPara great!

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:56.550
We'll become Divine Idols, just you wait!

00:17:56.810 --> 00:18:01.140
You say that, but not a one of you ranked up
before I intervened, did you?

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.290
My word.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.320
Is there even a point in competing with you, I wonder?

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.930
You should give them back, Maho-chan.

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:24.870
You should give everyone their
Dream Tickets back if you took them.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.580
These tickets are like an idol's body itself.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.780
After all, my body is made of PriTickets.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.800
Princess Falulu...

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.120
What are you saying?

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.610
Then all of my preparations will be for...

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:40.700
Please.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.730
Then how about this?

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.960
You oversee your academy's rules.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.980
Your parents are a prosecutor and a lawyer.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.720
And you're respected by all.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:06.300
No one will object to your judgements,

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:07.480
myself included.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.620
No objections!

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:14.090
I should tell you, my love for PriPara loses to none either!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.740
And just how will you demonstrate that?

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:19.050
Had you ranked up recently? I can't recall.

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:22.510
I present my judgment!

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:29.300
You can spout all the sophisms
about love you like, but a sin is a sin!

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:31.340
They shall not be overlooked.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:34.810
Shikyouin Hibiki, return the stolen Dream Tickets!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:36.370
All right!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:37.600
Encore! Encore!

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:38.570
Hibiki-sama!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.180
Come back again!
Encore! Encore!

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.680
Prince-sama!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.680
Please perform again!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:48.050
Encore! Encore!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:50.700
And what will we do about the game?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:54.500
Minami Mirei-kun, who hasn't won a single Grand Prix.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.210
Encore! Encore!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.290
Shall we not determine who is correct?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.000
Mirei!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:58.090
Encore! Encore!

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.280
You can bet we'll accept!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:04.240
We'll postpone your arrest until we've won!

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:05.730
No objections!

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.920
Capisce!

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:07.550
Hmph.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.320
Encore! Encore!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.300
Understood.

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.200
Encore! Encore!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.310
Come to mama, my little Dream Tickets!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.770
Encore! Encore!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:18.580
Were you lonely without your mama?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.820
Thanks, Falulu!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:23.890
That reminds me – I've yet to receive my Cyalume Charm.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.330
Encore! Encore!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.130
This golden charm...

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:27.880
Encore! Encore!

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:30.250
with a shining crown emblem, is most suited

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.520
to a Celeb idol such as you.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:33.210
Encore! Encore!

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:41.100
The Military Look Coord for the ivory knight alighted in PriPara.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:46.220
The gallant short jacket and golden frills about the waist are simply splendid!

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:17.120
Hibiki-san...

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:19.660
Why do you dress up as a boy?

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:21.000
Are you curious?

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:24.090
Then why don't you act opposite me today?

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:25.780
You want... me to act with you?

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:29.530
Next time, <i>Shikyouin Hibiki's Splendid Everyday Life</i>.
